/-!
# Left and right lifting properties

The left and right lifting properties (`MorphismProperty.llp` / `MorphismProperty.rlp`)
that were originally developed here, together with their stability under retracts,
(co)base change, composition and (co)products, have since been upstreamed to Mathlib
(`Mathlib.CategoryTheory.MorphismProperty.LiftingProperty`). This module is retained as a
placeholder that re-exports that development.
-/
